  "description": "A high-performance .NET SDK designed for smooth integration with Jordan's JoFatora e-invoicing system.\n      Built with clean architecture, fully async support, and simplified compliance with local tax regulations.\n     \n      Features:\n      - Full UBL 2.1 compliance\n      - Pre-submission validation\n      - Multi-currency support (JOD, USD, EUR)\n      - Comprehensive error handling\n      - Test data generation utilities",
